Package: paranoid-wallet
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Paranoid Zero <ignotus.nemo@proton.me>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, xdg-desktop-portal
Homepage: https://noid.network/
Description: Native ParanO(1)d wallet
 ParanO(1)d wallet with its private, locally supervised full node.
 Wallet data remains in the user's home directory when the package is removed.
